<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF‑8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>About — Yassin Creative Studio</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;600;700&family=Playfair+Display:wght@700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  body {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    margin: 0;
    background: #fff;
    color: #222;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .container {
    width: 90%;
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: auto;
    padding: 40px 0;
  }
  h1 {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: clamp(32px,4vw,48px);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(24px,3vw,32px);
    margin-top: 30px;
  }
  p {
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }
  .hero {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 60px 0;
  }
  .hero p {
    font-size: 18px;
    color: #555;
  }
  .cta-btn {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 20px;
    padding: 12px 24px;
    background: #222;
    color: #fff;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: 6px;
  }
  .impact {
    background: #f7f7f7;
    padding: 30px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    margin: 30px 0;
  }
  .impact h3 {
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .impact p {
    font-weight: 600;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container hero">
  <h1>On a mission to make second‑hand first choice</h1>
  <p>We want to show you just how great second‑hand can be — quality items should live long and be enjoyed by many.</p>
  <a href="#" class="cta-btn">Join Our Journey</a>
</div>

<div class="container">
  <h2>Who We Are</h2>
  <p>We started as a small idea: to help people pass on what they no longer use. From a modest beginning, we grew into a community that believes in sustainability, creativity, and minimalism.</p>
  <p>Today, our global presence bridges creativity and impact, connecting people through thoughtful design and meaningful experiences.</p>

  <div class="impact">
    <h3>Impact We Love</h3>
    <p>Every day, we help members create professional presentations that stand out — combining simplicity with global appeal.</p>
    <p>With each design we deliver, we help brands communicate their story clearly and with purpose.</p>
  </div>

  <h2>Our Philosophy</h2>
  <p>Quality matters. Communication matters. Simplicity matters.</p>
  <p>We believe in designs that speak clearly, perform reliably, and make a positive impression on global audiences.</p>
</div>

</body>
</html>
